{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2018-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1537660800, "end_date": 1538351999, "month_true_total": 367, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:55:57 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "45029916", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037156368", "personaname": "George", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/aroostookgeorge/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1413, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 337, "last_played": 1608501014, "avatar": "5af5f3c35d34e94c70401f9504573c22f5c9e7ea"}, "language": "english", "review": "A short, but satisfying game. It was like playing one of the novels, although a bit on the cliche side with the invasion of orks, a super weapon, and then [spoiler] a \"twist\" where, big non-surprise, Chaos [/spoiler]shows up. The bolter was my mainstay weapon for the first half, but bar none the thunder hammer and jet pack was god mode.", "timestamp_created": 1538342358, "timestamp_updated": 1538342358, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.550000011920928955", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "45019444", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145689780", "personaname": "Kaiser Lucillius", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KaiserLucillius/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 439, "playtime_forever": 618, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 553, "last_played": 1538305770, "avatar": "a533509e192a7f6c9b982c43f32af3499501c782"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the best game I have received from humble bundle and one of the best 40k games aswell.\nA truely great expereince where you get to play as a captain of the spacemarines but not just any spacemarine core the freaking ultramarines. If you like 40k or just 3rd person shooters I will highly recommend this game 10/10.\nThis game doesn't have the stuck in a place music problem that many other action shooters has.\nYou have a great arsenal at your disposal.\nBut best of all you get to use the Warhammer combined with a jetpack.", "timestamp_created": 1538306241, "timestamp_updated": 1538306241, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "45012347", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020481512", "personaname": "quaterni0", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198020481512/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 604, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 573, "last_played": 1546899788, "avatar": "eecb34e26ea59067475bc411c73da82162960079"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun single player campaign espescially if you are a 40K fan and don't care for strategy games.", "timestamp_created": 1538274143, "timestamp_updated": 1538274143, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "45009565", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139206375", "personaname": "Judr.Karel Pastelka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jurabike1/", "num_games_owned": 359, "num_reviews": 804, "playtime_forever": 85, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 85, "last_pla